<div class="short-bio">
    <p>I'm a photographer and digital media artist whose practice examines the politics of image-making in contested geographies, particularly Israel/Palestine. I work across 3D modeling, mapping, drone photography, and archival research to examine photography's entanglements with colonial and territorial politics.</p>
    <p>I'm an Assistant Professor of Photography at Parsons School of Design, The New School.</p>
